usage: run_all.py [-h] [--confirm-window] [--deadline DEADLINE] [--exclusive]
                  [--identity IDENTITY] [--base BASE] [--skip-instrument]
                  [--limit LIMIT] [--out-prefix OUT_PREFIX]

options:
  -h, --help            show this help message and exit
  --confirm-window
  --deadline DEADLINE
  --exclusive           use the exclusive readout path (default: shared-slots)
  --identity IDENTITY
  --base BASE
  --skip-instrument
  --limit LIMIT         items per stage (smoke test); 0 = the full stage
  --out-prefix OUT_PREFIX
                        write stage outputs under this directory instead of
                        the sweep root
